&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join our &lt;strong&gt;Finance &amp;amp; Strategy&lt;/strong&gt; team. In this role, you’ll play an integral part in building our business strategy, ensuring we make the most efficient investment and capital allocation decisions to accelerate our global growth.&lt;/p&gt;
