&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven ability to scale mobile architecture&lt;/strong&gt; within a large-scale codebase, ensuring performance and stability for millions of users.&lt;/p&gt;
